{"articleNo":"82625","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=82625&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[LINC사업단] ICDL 국제 자격증 강좌 선발자 명단 및 응시료 입금 안내(5/13~5/31)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.05.03","hit":"4004","attachments":[{"name":"선발자 명단.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=82625&attachNo=71831"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">ICDL 국제 자격증 강</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">좌 선발자 명단 및 응시료 입금 안내</span></span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 29.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 29.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span></span>&nbsp;금번 ICDL 국제 자격증에 많은 학생들이 지원하여 선발인원 40명이 마감되었으며, 공지에 따라 3,4학년을 대상으로 4학년 우선 선발 하였으니 3학년 학생들의 양해를 부탁드립니다. 아울러 학생들의 수요가 많았던 만큼 차기 강좌를 개설토록 노력하겠습니다. </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">[강좌개요 및 선발자 명단]</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 강좌기간 : </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2013.05.13.(월) ~ 2013.05.31.(금)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 강좌일시 : 평일 18시 ~ 21시(시험시간 18~22시)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 강좌장소 : </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">글로벌관</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 컴퓨터실(G707호)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 선발자 명단 : 첨부파일 참고</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 기타사항</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -90.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 90.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"